 of the most hotly debated topics of  the past year when it comes to the mcu  and the movie before we take a closer  look at the rumors here are the actors  that we  absolutely know will play a role  needless to say  spider-man will once again be played by  tom holland who has long been the most  popular spider-man in a live action film  and one can hardly imagine a movie  without him  alas his contract expires after this  film but nevertheless  we will likely see him again in doctor  strange and the multiverse of madness  naturally fans hope that his contract  will be extended one more time and many  assume that it will  whether this is the case is something  that only disney and sony know though  standing by his side will again be the  beautiful mj and his nerdy friend ned  leeds  they will also continue to be portrayed  by zendaya marie's derma coleman  and jacob batalon as is well known of  course ant-may can't be missing from  this trio  we look forward to seeing marissa to me  in this role again also back from high  school or netsuite heard betty brandt  and flash thompson who mostly uses high  school to trample on peter especially  when it comes to the multiverse which  will almost certainly play a big part  flash should play an interesting role  but we will talk more about that  later as you might expect these casts  also remain the same  with betty continuing to be played by  angry rice and thompson by  tony revolori if you look at the cast  overview you can't avoid reading the  name  benedict cumberbatch therefore we can  look forward to seeing what kind of  significance the role of doctor strange  will have in spidey's third film  it is just logical that he will be  featured since tom han is also supposed  to make an appearance in the multiverse  of madness  and when it comes to multiverses then  who should be appearing  if not the strange in addition daredevil  actor charlie cox has been spotted on  this set  for a long time rumors have been  circulating that the devil of hell's  kitchen would find a place in the mcu  the fact that the character may not be  already cast but that the already  existing character from the netflix  series will be integrated into the  spider verse  would certainly be a great surprise for  all fans unfortunately this has not yet  been officially confirmed  but the odds are good particularly  because the two-year non-use agreement  for the character which was imposed by  netflix has come to an end  it is conceivable that as a lawyer matt  murdock will first take on the case of  the disgraced peter parker  one thing has already been confirmed and  is fueling the rumors about the  multiverse  alfred molina will again slip into the  role of otto octavius aka  doctor octopus and this is 17 years  after spider-man 2.  in addition jaime fox will again embody  max dillon aka electro  the latter was the villain in the  amazing spider-man 2 rise of electro in  which andrew garfield  played the role of the friendly spider  the return of these two villains opens  the door to the multiverse wide open and  naturally creates room for heaps of  speculation  so fans hope to see not only these two  guys but that the sinister 6 will  finally find their way into a spider-man  movie  for this to happen however mysterio  would have to have survived or possibly  come from another earth  dog and electro will definitely not be  the same as in the other movies  that much has already been confirmed to  us perhaps not a villain but in any case  certainly a most hated character is of  course  also chief editor jay jonah jameson  after making his first appearance in  this spidey trilogy in the mid credits  scene  he is now said to have a larger role in  no way home  understandably so considering we can  surely already imagine how he will drag  peter's name through the mud  as mentioned in the beginning of the  video he will be played by jk  simmons as in the maguire spidey trilogy  the return of the two villains from  previous movies naturally sparked the  rumors surrounding toby maguire  and andrew garfield the movies featuring  the former spider-man actors didn't  actually play in the mcu  however with the rise of the multiverse  a comeback doesn't seem out of the  question so far  up to now all inquiries about it have  been denied by marvel and body actors  but as we know they have been told to  shut up by the film studios anyway  the animated film spider-man into the  spider-verse in 2018 has  already demonstrated that having more  spideys in one film is not a bad idea  and after all it was also honored with  an oscar so we believe we speak for all  fans when we say  this would be a dream come true and by  the way  it doesn't seem to be ruled out yet that  miles morales will make his appearance  in a live-action movie as the 4th  spider-man  after all he is the main character from  into the spider-verse  and as we know from a deleted scene from  homecoming he already exists in the mcu  everyone agrees on one rumor though in  case maguire and garfield should come  back  we also hope for kirsten dunst is mary  jane watson and emma stone to play gwen  stacy again  beforehand it's always difficult to talk  about the plot without question fan  fiction or personal imagination will  also play a role in the following part  what is clear is that the multiverse is  about to collapse  hence spidey suddenly has to face all  sorts of villains and people from the  other spider-man universes  the point in time was already spoiled by  alfred molina in an interview  the role of doctor octopus is to be  taken up again in spider-man no way home  precisely at the point when he drowned  in spider-man 2.  yet it's not just the bad guys who will  make things difficult for spidey  now that his true identity has been  revealed he'll either be on the run most  of the time or he will need to find  himself a very good lawyer  good thing we have matt murdock back  this is also where you could bring in  the lawyer jennifer walters  her alter ego is probably better known  to you as she-hulk  regarding the villains there is one  scenario we can imagine  best namely that the sinister six end of  the room  electro and doghog are already confirmed  as two out of the four  after all although the vulture has been  in prison since homecoming  it shouldn't be too difficult to break  out no mysterio the sandman  and craven the hunter would still be  missing from the original six  however it's more likely that these will  be replaced by scorpion  reno and the hobgoblin scorpion as we've  already seen is in prison with vulture  and thus he's already in the mcu reno  also already made an appearance and  let's call it the garfield verse  so the only one missing is hobgoblin  some of you may already know him from  the comics but peter's friends ned leeds  turns into him in a comic series  however it would be conceivable that an  evil equivalent of him comes from an  alternate universe to complicate  spider-man's life with the other five  villains  however as mentioned earlier he may not  have to fight them alone  as maguire and garfield have already  collected their experience fighting  against some of the sinister six  in addition they're also dr strange and  daredevil for us  it's still a matter of patience and we  hope that we can really see the film on  december 17th  and hopefully in theaters as in the  first two parts john watts will be  directing the movie  and the script has been taken care of by  chris mckenna and eric summers  besides the script of the first two  films both are working on ant-man and  the wasp  for the shooting some high schools had  to be temporarily closed once again  filming also took place in new york's  greenwich village neighborhood where  doctor strange sanctum is located since  the contract between sony and marvel  expired in 2019  it was initially not certain how things  would continue  sony was willing to extend the contract  but marvel wanted an equal split of  profits to share production costs  luckily the parties were able to come to  an agreement in september 2019.  as a result marvel studios will get  their merchandise rights and 25  of the revenue but will have to bear  quarter of the production cost  so that was our preview of spider-man no  way home  hopefully we were able to give you a  good insight and increase your  excitement for december  what do you think is it realistic to see  of three spideys in one single movie or  do you have a different theory regarding  the villains  let us know in the comment section and  if you liked the video feel free to give  it a thumbs up  see you next time  [Music]  you

